# vvaharness/validation/models/persona_report.py

The schema each persona subagent fills (`PersonaReport`) and the shape of the harness terminal state the host reads them from.

Source: `vvaharness/validation/models/persona_report.py` (lines 1-57)
Executor: code (schema for the personas' structured response)
Called from: `vvaharness/validation/subagents/_loader.sudo` (response_model), `vvaharness/validation/io/persona_report_stash.sudo`, `vvaharness/validation/synthesis/_consensus.sudo`

// src: vvaharness/validation/models/persona_report.py:28-32
HarnessTerminalState {
  sdk_persona_reports?: [{}]   // Claude cli/sdk route
  messages?: [ ]               // deepagents graph messages
}

// src: vvaharness/validation/models/persona_report.py:35-46
PersonaGateEntry {
  gate_name: String
  status: GateStatus   // pass | partial | fail | skip | invalid; an unrecognised value becomes invalid ("Fails closed to INVALID: scores 0.0, stays in the denominator")
  summary: String      // required
  details: String = ""
  evidence: [EvidenceAnchor] = []
  // extra keys ignored ("gpt-5.5 and peers add unknown keys")
}

// src: vvaharness/validation/models/persona_report.py:49-57
PersonaReport {
  persona: String
  tracking_id: String
  gates: [PersonaGateEntry]
  // extra keys ignored, so an appended synthesis-level field is not fatal
}
